module j3.ui.csslex — Tokenizer for `j3.ui.css`: `next(&lx)` returns the next `Token` (idents, numbers with units, hashes, strings, urls, functions, punctuation).

fn: next
const: T_EOF T_IDENT T_HASH T_NUM T_PCT T_STR T_URL T_FUNC T_DELIM T_COLON T_SEMI T_LBRACE T_RBRACE
    T_LPAREN T_RPAREN T_COMMA T_LBRACK T_RBRACK T_AT
struct Token: kind s e ch f us ue line col sp
struct Lexer: src pos line ls

